### Plans and entry prices

Entry prices as published in https://www.brevo.com/pricing.md on 2026-09-29, shown in USD per month (EUR and 15 other currencies are in that file). Prices change and depend on volume, seats, add-ons and currency, so treat the figures as "from" prices and check pricing.md for the current values.

- Free: free forever, no credit card required. For individuals and solopreneurs building an online presence.
- Starter: from $9/month (about $97/year billed annually). Single user starting with email and multichannel marketing; emails from 5,000 per month.
- Standard: from $18/month (about $194/year billed annually). Small businesses ready to automate and A/B test campaigns; adds marketing automation, advanced reporting, send-time optimization, web tracking and landing pages.
- Professional: from $350/month (about $3,780/year billed annually). Teams using data and AI across channels; adds WhatsApp, web push, multi-user access, contact scoring, ecommerce features and phone support; emails from 150,000 per month.
- Enterprise: custom pricing, contact sales. For companies with 1M+ contacts needing custom solutions and full data control; adds multi-account management, custom objects, mobile wallet, loyalty engine, dedicated IP and SSO/SAML.
